         <component>
            <section ID="L4361c492-df71-4af6-bf27-9261c52cb7e2">
               <id root="21f283f4-eb47-4205-97d0-026306b76838"/>
               <code code="34068-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DOSAGE &amp; ADMINISTRATION SECTION"/>
               <title>DIRECTIONS:</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Adults and children take four droppers full twice a day for stamina building and muscle recovery; best if taken 1/2 hour prior to workout. For more strenuous workouts, dosage may be increased to eight droppers full.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Consult a physician for use in children under 12 years of age.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20250129"/>
            </section>
         </component>
